  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe UI link on Windows and all other platforms verifies that the listening window owns the token before the CLI sends any tool calls:\n\n1. `crates/app/src/mcp/link.rs`:\n   - Add `token_proof(token, nonce, role)` with pure-Rust SipHash-2-4 to prove token ownership without sending the raw token over the socket.\n   - Update `hello_line`, `hello_matches`, and `hello_ok` for mutual verification.\n   - Add zero new dependencies and zero `unsafe` code.\n2. `crates/app/src/mcp/listen.rs`:\n   - Return the server proof in the hello answer after `hello_matches` succeeds.\n3. `crates/app/src/mcp/link_client.rs`:\n   - `open` creates a fresh nonce, checks the server proof in constant time, and refuses peers that fail to prove the token.\n   - `read_answer_line` reads at most `MAX_ANSWER_LINE + 1` bytes (16 MiB limit) and returns `ReadLineError::TooLong` when a line exceeds the limit.\n4. `crates/app/tests/mcp_live/ui_link.rs`:\n   - Add `false_server_on_stale_entry_is_refused_with_no_tool_calls_sent`.\n\n## Decisions\n\nRecorded in `docs/decisions/3874-windows-stale-link.md`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test -j 4 -p camcraft-app --lib mcp::link_client`: 3 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -j 4 -p camcraft-app --test mcp_live`: 22 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo clippy -j 4 -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean, 0 warnings\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `camcraft_app::mcp::link_client::tests::read_answer_line_accepts_valid_line`\n- `camcraft_app::mcp::link_client::tests::read_answer_line_rejects_oversized_line`\n- `camcraft_app::mcp::link_client::tests::read_answer_line_rejects_oversized_line_without_newline`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::false_server_on_stale_entry_is_refused_with_no_tool_calls_sent`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::the_link_folder_is_the_users_own`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::the_link_file_follows_the_open_project`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::a_wrong_token_is_refused_and_the_window_goes_on_serving`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::bad_ui_arguments_are_usage_errors`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::a_cli_call_with_no_window_says_so_and_exits_3`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::an_unauthenticated_client_holding_the_link_times_out_and_releases_it`\n- `mcp_live::ui_link::a_second_ui_call_during_a_slow_call_reports_busy_and_exits_4`\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Full workspace batch and release heavy lanes (only `camcraft-app` link code changed).\n- Linux and macOS runtime execution (verified locally on Windows; pure-Rust code uses no platform FFI).\n\nChangelog: UI link: verify token proof from window and bound line reads\nFixes #3874\n",
